        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As such, we offer the unbundling of the air transportation product by charging fees for services many U.S.",
        "start_character": 27406,
        "end_character": 27512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In most of these cities, we provide service to more than one of our leisure destinations which are offered either on a year-round or seasonal basis.",
        "start_character": 14725,
        "end_character": 14873
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Petersburg-Clearwater International Airport, we provide more than 97 percent of scheduled service in these markets.",
        "start_character": 36564,
        "end_character": 36679
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "That same year, we also implemented Navitaire, a new reservation system that we hope will continue to improve the way we manage customer interactions, reservations, and allow for dynamically priced ancillary products.",
        "start_character": 47883,
        "end_character": 48100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To this end, we are working to strengthen customer engagement, while affording a more elastic, reliable information technology infrastructure with significant development advantages for marketing as well as for other business units across the Company.",
        "start_character": 32163,
        "end_character": 32414
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have consciously developed a business model which distinguishes us from the traditional airline approach:",
        "start_character": 13281,
        "end_character": 13389
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed a unique business model that primarily focuses on leisure travelers in under-served cities.",
        "start_character": 12758,
        "end_character": 12867
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We indirectly compete with various carriers that provide nonstop service to our leisure destinations from airports near our cities.",
        "start_character": 37899,
        "end_character": 38030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate a low-cost, low utilization passenger airline marketed primarily to leisure travelers in under-served cities, allowing us to sell air transportation both on a stand-alone basis and bundled with the sale of air-related and third party services and products.",
        "start_character": 592,
        "end_character": 859
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide air transportation through fixed fee agreements and charter service on a year-round and ad hoc basis.",
        "start_character": 3325,
        "end_character": 3437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide unbundled air-related services and products in conjunction with air transportation for an additional cost to customers.",
        "start_character": 2078,
        "end_character": 2208
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001362468-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001362468-26-000008-61e5cf56416358ed",
        "accession_number": "0001362468-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We seek to sell our product directly to our customers as opposed to through outside sales channels, thus largely avoiding the fees charged by travel websites (Expedia, Orbitz or Travelocity) and traditional global distribution systems (“GDS”) (Sabre or Worldspan).",
        "start_character": 24603,
        "end_character": 24867
      }
    ]
